<pre class='metadata'>
Title: Prefetch Activation Beacon API
Shortname: prefetch-activation-beacon
Level: None
Status: w3c/UD
Repository: explainers-by-googlers/prefetch-activation-beacon
URL: https://explainers-by-googlers.github.io/prefetch-activation-beacon
Editor: Jiacheng Guo, Google https://google.com, gjc@google.com
Abstract: This specification defines the on-prefetch-activation HTTP response header, which allows an origin server to specify a same-origin endpoint to be notified via a browser-dispatched HTTP GET request when a speculatively prefetched resource is activated by a user navigation.
